sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Bank User / Analyst
    participant UI as Dashboard UI
    participant Fetcher as Profile Fetcher
    participant Extractor as Feature Extractor
    participant Predictor as Prediction Engine
    participant DB as Database / History Mgr
    participant Report as Report Generator
    
    User->>UI: Enter Instagram Username
    UI->>Fetcher: fetch_profile(username)
    Fetcher->>Fetcher: Request from External API (Apify/RapidAPI)
    Fetcher-->>UI: Raw Profile Data JSON
    UI->>Extractor: extract_features(raw_data)
    Extractor-->>UI: Engineered Features (DataFrame)
    UI->>Predictor: predict(features)
    Predictor->>Predictor: Load .pkl Model & Scaler
    Predictor->>Predictor: Compute Risk Score & SHAP
    Predictor-->>UI: Prediction Result (Fake/Real)
    UI->>DB: save_analysis_history(result)
    DB-->>UI: Confirm Save
    opt Generate PDF
        UI->>Report: generate_single_report(result)
        Report-->>UI: PDF Document
        UI-->>User: Download PDF
    end
    UI-->>User: Display Results & Risk Score
